{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/rb7n9xcxhz156hci3pipa7c0vaouueu.mp3","text":"我刚当上秉烛人的时候，花了三个月整，才读完司岁台的所有卷宗，而堆积在您这里的文件，数量也......相当可观。我想，我应该有足够的时间来熟悉工作吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/35/49k07tg0xv8zkva5898hoahbkw2tak1.mp3","text":"我刚当上秉烛人的时候，花了三个月整，才读完司岁台的所有卷宗，而堆积在您这里的文件，数量也......相当可观。我想，我应该有足够的时间来熟悉工作吧？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/q3i55axf4651rhd9zjd0gig0ey7d4p7.mp3","text":"博士？我跟您一块走......唔，克洛丝姐和乌有哥说今天要带我“拜山门”，和在船上的干员们都打个招呼，他们很热情，比我们相识时更热情......稍等，您是要巡视全舰？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/9wkg04jf56lqc5ooaug3bct2oz7bns6.mp3","text":"这套刀剑，是父亲在玉门亲自为我打的。“驱巨兽之影，察社稷之患”，秉烛人需要处理的事务，可没法单纯仰赖武力......呃，武功，我当然有在勤加练习。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/ouqjc31bz3pxkhp9kxy57mkqyj7gxwr.mp3","text":"嗯，我确实和麟青砚认识。我们分属司岁台与大理寺，职能不一样。我对罗德岛当然有一些怀疑，来之前是，来之后更是。不过“干员惊蛰”在追查的事情，我不会过问。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/93/bq93f0uvpz4f8b3wf56ykibmgcv3c3k.mp3","text":"博士？我跟您一块走......唔，克洛丝姐和乌有哥说今天要带我“拜山门”，和在船上的干员们都打个招呼，他们很热情，比我们相识时更热情......稍等，您是要巡视全舰？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/9drokiyljt68dljwr0sa2t1qc5aya93.mp3","text":"这套刀剑，是父亲在玉门亲自为我打的。“驱巨兽之影，察社稷之患”，秉烛人需要处理的事务，可没法单纯仰赖武力......呃，武功，我当然有在勤加练习。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/pghgipax25jfpblfi1j5pftctqfqz0k.mp3","text":"嗯，我确实和麟青砚认识。我们分属司岁台与大理寺，职能不一样。我对罗德岛当然有一些怀疑，来之前是，来之后更是。不过“干员惊蛰”在追查的事情，我不会过问。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/aqefbnkav4vy9kszwk7ucppvifc9mdt.mp3","text":"刚刚那是，魏公的外甥？不，不算熟悉，只是小时候父亲常常告诉我，要多向人家看齐。后来听说陈小姐辞去了警司职务，那天父亲没跟我说一句话。现在想起来，我的确很钦佩她。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/o73m8mx25wkqs1yiuzqnn065w2uepcf.mp3","text":"父亲让我去大荒城，是希望我多历练。但几十年前，他和宗师也曾为打一把好刀在铸剑坊熬了通宵，耽误了第二天的执勤。行差踏错当然不应该，可是我想，父亲的本意，也不是让我丢了那点心气。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/j2saie05b7c15r8r7e234hgfb4t3ryy.mp3","text":"刚刚那是，魏公的外甥？不，不算熟悉，只是小时候父亲常常告诉我，要多向人家看齐。后来听说陈小姐辞去了警司职务，那天父亲没跟我说一句话。现在想起来，我的确很钦佩她。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/rb99e2ddhpzfa8q16kkesybhmljtwvf.mp3","text":"父亲让我去大荒城，是希望我多历练。但几十年前，他和宗师也曾为打一把好刀在铸剑坊熬了通宵，耽误了第二天的执勤。行差踏错当然不应该，可是我想，父亲的本意，也不是让我丢了那点心气。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/rocsks9nni8aa6p6k73n8s3yy979928.mp3","text":"我会盯紧他们兄弟姐妹，但年在打麻将，我总不能一直在旁边看着。您见过年随手变出那些夸张的铸物，依然觉得她......只是有点烦人？您没在装糊涂，这才是棘手的地方。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/87/tcfd2i6lpjghj4skfu76i321mma3juu.mp3","text":"甲板夺旗赛，比的当然是腿上的功夫。明明是我第一个攀上了舰桥，结果那个沃尔珀姐姐骑着法杖从我眼前飞过，把旗子抢走了......博士，分明是她作弊，您怎么反过来说我争强好胜？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/967fiwcuyauy4spsou16j60rmbzlmdb.mp3","text":"这是秉烛人随身的册子。我确实记录了一些对您的观察......很抱歉，博士，但我起码确认了一件事：您是这艘船的航灯，而您也的确只是个普通人。我会撕掉那几页，也会保护您的安危。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/9rrxea2nz0dxvu15i8pzqrn3fxwgamd.mp3","text":"我会盯紧他们兄弟姐妹，但年在打麻将，我总不能一直在旁边看着。您见过年随手变出那些夸张的铸物，依然觉得她......只是有点烦人？您没在装糊涂，这才是棘手的地方。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/hq2fhhjt6lgppnghb9ih7ra77p4fo4f.mp3","text":"甲板夺旗赛，比的当然是腿上的功夫。明明是我第一个攀上了舰桥，结果那个沃尔珀姐姐骑着法杖从我眼前飞过，把旗子抢走了......博士，分明是她作弊，您怎么反过来说我争强好胜？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/38/ppdliqotqcjcg4uh1yn2xmvz0xanva1.mp3","text":"这是秉烛人随身的册子。我确实记录了一些对您的观察......很抱歉，博士，但我起码确认了一件事：您是这艘船的航灯，而您也的确只是个普通人。我会撕掉那几页，也会保护您的安危。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/ffu2fhbp6kp4r3fcg40d82ro8czrr6f.mp3","text":"兽与厚土行，秉烛入长夜......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/86/dzwjuotfsyo4mdsalmfw7reo89zamij.mp3","text":"兽与厚土行，秉烛入长夜......","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/q1trchencq9teoe21t5cbumhg3if9s4.mp3","text":"博士，我叫左乐。罗德岛上代理人的数量，快赶上炎国本土了，司岁台早就该派人过来一趟。其实我们之前便寄过一封公函。只不过，贵司似乎忘了回复？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/kgjk0chaigfjkiv96k2ggrg0ztv44u8.mp3","text":"博士，我叫左乐。罗德岛上代理人的数量，快赶上炎国本土了，司岁台早就该派人过来一趟。其实我们之前便寄过一封公函。只不过，贵司似乎忘了回复？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/ceu7p2r2hw682g4l13th736h5vtycnr.mp3","text":"想不到一家医药公司，对战场的记录与分析也这么专业。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/j5uxk3by6n6ecvplztmd6p1callpz6q.mp3","text":"想不到一家医药公司，对战场的记录与分析也这么专业。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/4d7gj755q2jd4h7r3lz0ho616wxnyin.mp3","text":"实在抱歉，左乐官职在身，恐怕无法接受任何形式的“晋升”......呃，我的意思是头衔免了，其他的福利还是可以保留的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/b64z7azkvb5hfhr5udwtwuzte2mrklr.mp3","text":"实在抱歉，左乐官职在身，恐怕无法接受任何形式的“晋升”......呃，我的意思是头衔免了，其他的福利还是可以保留的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/doqawp8b8m1tdqaygm78p3r1txrerlm.mp3","text":"每一座在天灾中穿行的巨构，都有它独特的意义。尚蜀将山水搬入移动城市，玉门以屏风卫独对风沙，那么罗德岛呢，你们究竟载着怎样的信念在航行？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/i21rwsx1gs214us7o1x49b8s2p7ptfk.mp3","text":"每一座在天灾中穿行的巨构，都有它独特的意义。尚蜀将山水搬入移动城市，玉门以屏风卫独对风沙，那么罗德岛呢，你们究竟载着怎样的信念在航行？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/b6voql8mxlndl1nwmo68c75121px9ht.mp3","text":"愿尽绵薄之力。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/tnhoshtntr3f50ts1laree93glz2qrr.mp3","text":"愿尽绵薄之力。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/c4z0ino1kj0d5tvhuczqhq82ik85bho.mp3","text":"良才善用，能者居之。左乐当尽全力。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/ebepsqj7g8d7akrjj754ihg8jrcsc81.mp3","text":"良才善用，能者居之。左乐当尽全力。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/c1kd3aiif3rkfqanmh72eu01qmdrf38.mp3","text":"既然箭在弦上，那又何必踌躇？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/mt4zjjwqr9uwhndxf177q3o8bn3yv6o.mp3","text":"既然箭在弦上，那又何必踌躇？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/mqkktl7sdz0rhm02r4p0wl1o3k9593g.mp3","text":"刀势无形，别欺它在匣内。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/af/n9btk5gcoroluzt3z6atrw5sfjohy1n.mp3","text":"刀势无形，别欺它在匣内。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/13vmou1ola1syl4zdjbmq4hmazk0961.mp3","text":"接下来，您的话将是军令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/30/1kjygm1430it6ktu4hxhm9bxj5ka9so.mp3","text":"情势复杂，我当便宜行事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/sqi97mbv3528vx0692szvdhz0oyyifw.mp3","text":"接下来，您的话将是军令。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/qtskmqim3pv2kqxfgblydbw27h1swgv.mp3","text":"情势复杂，我当便宜行事。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/8nymkflkeboqn4mdecdnfu9qohv75sz.mp3","text":"身临乱局，牵一发而动全身。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/j03b2558xdprpts7zi94jxx4yz9sg87.mp3","text":"不会遗漏任何风吹草动。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/hjjn3ruhuv39nmvhxoyxrdl927es1sf.mp3","text":"身临乱局，牵一发而动全身。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/bmfkm6eyrokhbot5il5o4742yntgi27.mp3","text":"不会遗漏任何风吹草动。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/c535di6zfu5i2lfsxsnzf6ulqz0pqxg.mp3","text":"各位留步，此路不通。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/73/mypxu3rk6e0uevmltinqgg8huluur50.mp3","text":"你们胆敢造次！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/8zzr12rb4ymo0bo97727hsc81hfkxty.mp3","text":"佑序有炎，大狩维天。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/rgz13qdpvui1gi9n70wtel3mwa6t4jq.mp3","text":"烛不盈寸，也能驱散万古长夜！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/q6zfsk53m3inbxd3pax37b3nnu8cesv.mp3","text":"各位留步，此路不通。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/31/qqhcnbicyhdu19vrrj6i1th7o6aicdo.mp3","text":"你们胆敢造次！","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/d32wklj8caohoa7nr2oepqzyj3ijv8n.mp3","text":"佑序有炎，大狩维天。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/2bjhbjtfo75rzmjnjjbrokwpk6n5dv6.mp3","text":"烛不盈寸，也能驱散万古长夜！","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/ccvbzj2hrr99x8xdohfgaqmbisze9g8.mp3","text":"险中求全胜，真是艺高人胆大。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/rx8w4d3xlck5u6l361v5lvdz4qr3si3.mp3","text":"险中求全胜，真是艺高人胆大。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/h60qk4fydtw2lfc37cwrjb0yt51jwsk.mp3","text":"兵无常势，水无常形。这样过人的谋划与决断......博士，我无从想象您的过往。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/l9qh5nhyjxpo3ta2mcwrbnvr3raxa6n.mp3","text":"兵无常势，水无常形。这样过人的谋划与决断......博士，我无从想象您的过往。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/brg9lu88zod21rlth8bf05oay8de54a.mp3","text":"人总想尽善尽美，却难免百密一疏。博士，事已经成了，就别再多想了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/3oppafazzocn3rgw20ccmcvyixuroga.mp3","text":"人总想尽善尽美，却难免百密一疏。博士，事已经成了，就别再多想了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/8fjhwjcf3xdp0ibutjxfvz7m41prpe5.mp3","text":"司岁台做事，自然有万全的准备。善后的事交给我，您先离开吧。放心，我轻功好，追得上您。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/goef8wm6hvplezgq8eznrwuqfm4o7cg.mp3","text":"司岁台做事，自然有万全的准备。善后的事交给我，您先离开吧。放心，我轻功好，追得上您。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/48/j8sipnbgpc1ztey1dc4j0cig1ewz43t.mp3","text":"我住过军帐，也睡过田埂，没那么多讲究。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/sc3vwxmgurj6osydj0nglyhbda9gse1.mp3","text":"我住过军帐，也睡过田埂，没那么多讲究。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/8eqzqmaj30wz5jjc4ldsj856hg9l3vo.mp3","text":"想必您是有要紧事吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/bfmikvgeblh8ygh3kajg9lr7x6qpq9b.mp3","text":"想必您是有要紧事吧？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/dswq8m08qir38yek2ix3igpu2rdsni5.mp3","text":"博士，手谈一局？还是再比赛一次夺旗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/pvvw8g1slstyiivvqghrhk6whd3xh9z.mp3","text":"博士，手谈一局？还是再比赛一次夺旗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/p5uxu1dd60b4i6mm8u7l3kk266173uh.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/hdnxnhu29am11qp5obgwgfeefea9c74.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/5jny8urfdoxn3mr1mb3ifseb87ryzv9.mp3","text":"北地征事忙，田家少闲月......因为公务，我常年奔走于炎国各地。炎国人总是忙碌，但每年的这个时候，总有一顿饭、一声鼓、一句团圆......阴影未散，而烟火也不会断绝。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/qexut5lgl1vomd3bx9zl7cekg2dn94a.mp3","text":"北地征事忙，田家少闲月......因为公务，我常年奔走于炎国各地。炎国人总是忙碌，但每年的这个时候，总有一顿饭、一声鼓、一句团圆......阴影未散，而烟火也不会断绝。","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/2p748q3j35snku2odvpie0rk8i0bltv.mp3","text":"好巧。您想必有话对我说......是也不是？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4121_zuole/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/r34viz4o83hpp781a1gveyg0f94x8s6.mp3","text":"好巧。您想必有话对我说......是也不是？","alt":"voice_custom/char_4121_zuole_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/ienexjhd4zjv7idpi2plrlgq9duq8ub.mp3","text":"我刚当上秉烛人的时候，花了三个月整，才读完司岁台的所有卷宗，而堆积在您这里的文件，数量也......相当可观。我想，我应该有足够的时间来熟悉工作吧？","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/ab8dsh7jgkptdebxm3qdqmw5devmz6k.mp3","text":"博士？我跟您一块走......唔，克洛丝姐和乌有哥说今天要带我“拜山门”，和在船上的干员们都打个招呼，他们很热情，比我们相识时更热情......稍等，您是要巡视全舰？","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/54/5ho5wsryux2g04hb3khugcanuio70nv.mp3","text":"这套刀剑，是父亲在玉门亲自为我打的。“驱巨兽之影，察社稷之患”，秉烛人需要处理的事务，可没法单纯仰赖武力......呃，武功，我当然有在勤加练习。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/86/kekvk2nzd5csev0ueg8qofwrsa8ht1b.mp3","text":"嗯，我确实和麟青砚认识。我们分属司岁台与大理寺，职能不一样。我对罗德岛当然有一些怀疑，来之前是，来之后更是。不过“干员惊蛰”在追查的事情，我不会过问。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/nspsx04qbyb6pkwteq1jeyousv8jpa6.mp3","text":"刚刚那是，魏公的外甥？不，不算熟悉，只是小时候父亲常常告诉我，要多向人家看齐。后来听说陈小姐辞去了警司职务，那天父亲没跟我说一句话。现在想起来，我的确很钦佩她。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/15ehgsa9hsdlam9d6q41wel2pi4h6j0.mp3","text":"父亲让我去大荒城，是希望我多历练。但几十年前，他和宗师也曾为打一把好刀在铸剑坊熬了通宵，耽误了第二天的执勤。行差踏错当然不应该，可是我想，父亲的本意，也不是让我丢了那点心气。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/7zyjj2yze0mpm8jtzk1cz8f6poq9aal.mp3","text":"我会盯紧他们兄弟姐妹，但年在打麻将，我总不能一直在旁边看着。您见过年随手变出那些夸张的铸物，依然觉得她......只是有点烦人？您没在装糊涂，这才是棘手的地方。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/1hwr4rpumr1rl2eiah21i94e6yi3j0o.mp3","text":"甲板夺旗赛，比的当然是腿上的功夫。明明是我第一个攀上了舰桥，结果那个沃尔珀姐姐骑着法杖从我眼前飞过，把旗子抢走了......博士，分明是她作弊，您怎么反过来说我争强好胜？","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/lq4dfreeaho62cfkv32hnz6rzwysgvv.mp3","text":"这是秉烛人随身的册子。我确实记录了一些对您的观察......很抱歉，博士，但我起码确认了一件事：您是这艘船的航灯，而您也的确只是个普通人。我会撕掉那几页，也会保护您的安危。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/15d639jn4ljxzpkbrolh8lqj6ftgtju.mp3","text":"兽与厚土行，秉烛入长夜......","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/8ligtqxux7t5o720o27q429u24wmcd2.mp3","text":"博士，我叫左乐。罗德岛上代理人的数量，快赶上炎国本土了，司岁台早就该派人过来一趟。其实我们之前便寄过一封公函。只不过，贵司似乎忘了回复？","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/oktqioufi0hrp0sihhqz6cjxssw1g03.mp3","text":"想不到一家医药公司，对战场的记录与分析也这么专业。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/23ntwru1da7anur9z5ms4hy4wmz9l6h.mp3","text":"实在抱歉，左乐官职在身，恐怕无法接受任何形式的“晋升”......呃，我的意思是头衔免了，其他的福利还是可以保留的。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/4huhxo018dy234rlq7nva2mol1vi19b.mp3","text":"每一座在天灾中穿行的巨构，都有它独特的意义。尚蜀将山水搬入移动城市，玉门以屏风卫独对风沙，那么罗德岛呢，你们究竟载着怎样的信念在航行？","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/cwia4fxr50no2e0kv4qofuxtot8reh0.mp3","text":"愿尽绵薄之力。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/e9p68gsjj7uqgdiffz6mjelr6p7gsg0.mp3","text":"良才善用，能者居之。左乐当尽全力。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/7z53k52ve7afy3ih0wy1w3yaorv3heu.mp3","text":"既然箭在弦上，那又何必踌躇？","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/seovgbbkgjj7ryolyxgc6apbnqiuoy5.mp3","text":"刀势无形，别欺它在匣内。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/pb6lux5mudsj9w4f4lv0jgn858n4x74.mp3","text":"接下来，您的话将是军令。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/de/d7pxzn6y9vnutibmsgb0pq7trbyhzhx.mp3","text":"情势复杂，我当便宜行事。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/dnlt8ip0dnthleshbkwhbxku3uipdh5.mp3","text":"身临乱局，牵一发而动全身。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/35/bfxqis9qp5wwdxefjvbrj4moi9mzn4s.mp3","text":"不会遗漏任何风吹草动。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/swogq8vgn61zxpywcpoidaxs9frgw8g.mp3","text":"各位留步，此路不通。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/63g68j41p4f8rsc7ubs8ka9txlpjz9u.mp3","text":"你们胆敢造次！","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/tqon2jadwy7ndj1b7ech2hfkrggliqu.mp3","text":"佑序有炎，大狩维天。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/nlse1b0ume7inh7bbju6dkjqyqquylj.mp3","text":"烛不盈寸，也能驱散万古长夜！","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/odfaaujv5tuyq62amyh0vzvmvy6twt1.mp3","text":"险中求全胜，真是艺高人胆大。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/6wy20rmyrptucr4irx1oh3jbrdk3yx9.mp3","text":"兵无常势，水无常形。这样过人的谋划与决断......博士，我无从想象您的过往。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/8qascdd1tz2xdxe1tzrhauajiai2yuy.mp3","text":"人总想尽善尽美，却难免百密一疏。博士，事已经成了，就别再多想了。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/4z37rnwn04m3k24d4z2jcjoa9vovgsl.mp3","text":"司岁台做事，自然有万全的准备。善后的事交给我，您先离开吧。放心，我轻功好，追得上您。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/9tk4zehr9zo9hskorwu56d5xbn10sno.mp3","text":"我住过军帐，也睡过田埂，没那么多讲究。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/fwk4jkc6b9kae9h2pxtstn874e0mji7.mp3","text":"想必您是有要紧事吧？","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/ky0g9v2m63uirafpgf520xm88ds2juv.mp3","text":"博士，手谈一局？还是再比赛一次夺旗？","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b3/s83osyi4sfw0uxiwb55a427xykkn98v.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_038.mp3","text":"北地征事忙，田家少闲月......因为公务，我常年奔走于炎国各地。炎国人总是忙碌，但每年的这个时候，总有一顿饭、一声鼓、一句团圆......阴影未散，而烟火也不会断绝。"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/aamzd2vllzkkk2fgsiyu92e0hmylrh5.mp3","text":"好巧。您想必有话对我说......是也不是？","alt":"voice/char_4121_zuole/cn_042.mp3"}]}}